<http://data.silknow.org/object/a5852ca3-81ab-36d5-aedd-7eccc3a4efb1>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "brocaded, 1790-1840, Persian"@en , "Dress fabric of silk brocaded with silk and metal thread\nCream warp-faced ground. The metal thread is silver strip close S-wound on a yellow silk core. Floss silk has been used for the brocading. The pattern is formed by off-set rows of large vertical floral stems, each growing from a pink mound with green and pink leaves, three pink and light and  dark blue flowers and two pink buds. Some leaves form a sort of knot with two loose ends - see the blue and silver one]. Broad outlines have been worked in metal thread. Each motif is 19 cm tall and alternates with a small spray of three flowers."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/68ab7f9e-22a5-3101-99b0-abca44a9c052> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/d4a225d8-f6d2-3ac2-a899-8d911a66d255> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/96fcbef7-3046-31c1-a085-691dc193e76f> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5915f814-2c9a-3e22-92ac-b16ca2c17d20> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/1bf32b88-1db2-3aac-9135-ae06c9f88025> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/dfa9a3c8-387a-354f-809b-a705a7934fb3> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/ac4ac9c9-f648-3aa1-ad48-0a5bcb4c7edc> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5eb47eab-4041-3b42-aeb8-4b7349ab210a> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5dfe460f-20ad-37ef-888e-28d32f5dc465> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "brocaded, 1790-1840, Persian"@en , "Dress fabric of silk brocaded with silk and metal thread\nCream warp-faced ground. The metal thread is silver strip close S-wound on a yellow silk core. Floss silk has been used for the brocading. The pattern is formed by off-set rows of large vertical floral stems, each growing from a pink mound with green and pink leaves, three pink and light and  dark blue flowers and two pink buds. Some leaves form a sort of knot with two loose ends - see the blue and silver one]. Broad outlines have been worked in metal thread. Each motif is 19 cm tall and alternates with a small spray of three flowers."@en ;
